				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$W_{{{\text{attribute}}\left( i \right)}} = \frac{{\hbox{max} C_{i} - \hbox{min} C_{i} }}{{\mathop \sum \nolimits_{j} (\hbox{max} C_{j} - \hbox{min} C_{j} )}},$$\end{document}Wattributei=maxCi-minCi∑j(maxCj-minCj),where Ci represents the coefficients of the individual levels of attribute i and j represents the number of attributes.
